			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Fire Plume Ridge is the volcano at the center of {link:un-goro-crater}Un'Goro{/link}, a charred cone that pours smoke and heat over the whole crater. Its slopes belong to elementals of living flame. At its heart, on paths of blackened rock, dwells {link:blazerunner}Blazerunner{/link}, an elemental wrapped in an aura that no blade has pierced. He guards a cave that holds the Golden Flame. The heat of the ridge is fierce enough to overcome the unwary, and the explorer {link:ringo}Ringo{/link} nearly died of it. Those who study the crater believe the volcano may warm its springs.]=],
