		{
			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Terror Run is the south-western plain of the crater, and it has earned its name. Stegodons graze across it in heavy herds, and devilsaurs hunt among them. Marshal Expeditions came here to dig for the bones of dead beasts. The diggers soon found that the living ones were far more numerous, and far more dangerous. {link:spark-nilminer}Spark Nilminer{/link}, the chief digger of the expedition, still speaks of the place with open dread. He calls it a death trap, and he does not mean it as a jest.]=],
		},
	},
