			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Fungal Rock is a hollow of caves in the north-east of the crater, and it is the lair of {link:un-goro-crater}Un'Goro{/link}'s great apes. Gorillas, stompers and thunderers defend it, and none are fiercer than the mighty ape the {link:tauren}tauren{/link} hunter {link:torwa-pathfinder}Torwa{/link} calls {link:u-cha}U'cha{/link}. The inventor {link:karna-remtravel}Karna Remtravel{/link} sent her mechanical ape {link:a-me-01}A-Me 01{/link} into these caves to watch the apes up close. The apes were not fooled for long. When travellers found her again, she lay silent and badly dented at the mouth of the caves.]=],
