			text = [=[Linken's forgotten errand turns out to be one of the great deeds of the crater. He came to face {link:blazerunner}Blazerunner{/link}, the flame-wrapped elemental of {link:fire-plume-ridge}Fire Plume Ridge{/link}, and to take from him an artifact of terrible power. When his memory returns, he does not claim the deed for himself. He gives it to the one who restored him.]=],
		},
		{
