			text = [=[A wrecked raft lay beside a small pond, far from any water that could have carried it. At the bottom of the pond lay a sodden pack: a compass, a rolled map and a key shaped like a lion's head. Linken looked at them and something stirred. He remembered a sword that he had to strengthen, though not why. He sent it north to {link:donova-snowden}Donova Snowden{/link} in {link:winterspring}Winterspring{/link}.]=],
